title Cassette Bluetooth (T8, synthetic names): the Input picker with paired devices the launcher says are not connected: a USB card (plain row), a connected headset (Evolve 65, 16 kHz) and two dimmed rows (Beats Fit Pro; and one without a remembered name, "Bluetooth device 5D:1A") with the reason "Not connected: connect it in Settings > Bluetooth" under the name; Enter on a dimmed row says why and stays
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT input-paired
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key s
wait 300
key down
key enter
wait 300
expect text "USB Audio Device"
expect text "Evolve 65"
expect text "Beats Fit Pro"
expect text "Bluetooth device 5D:1A"
expect text "Not connected: connect it in Settings > Bluetooth"
shot input-paired
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Not available: Not connected: connect it in Settings > Bluetooth"
say Enter on a paired device that is not connected: the notice says why, the picker stays
shot input-paired-refused
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Not available: Not connected: connect it in Settings > Bluetooth"
shot input-paired-refused-2
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
expect text "SOFT"
expect text "BT"
expect noquit
